        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use of optic fibre, fixed IP access network per hour</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use of optic fibre, fixed IP access network per hour
The data set represents the fiber optic fixed network in Switzerland; UUID: c4905e85-a62a-3f9c-b41b-60dc1707453f
The dataset represents the optic fibre network in Switzerland. The reference year for network traffic is 2014. The equipment is based on information from 2010 but is deemed the most actual. A lifetime of 6 years is assumed. Amount of electricity consumed is based on the network electricity intensity (kWh/GB) information from the Telefonica Access Network.. The functional unit = 1 GB.
Location: Data for Swiss networks
Technology: The mix of Swiss access transmission network, fixed.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c4905e85-a62a-3f9c-b41b-60dc1707453f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
